      "text": "Reproducibility:  data/ is git-ignored and fully rebuildable.  Put a FRED_API_KEY in .env, run notebooks/prototype.ipynb top-to-bottom,\nand every CSV above is regenerated from source.  Nothing is hand-edited downstream of the extract step - the FOMC calendar is the only\nmanual input, and it is versioned inside the notebook itself.",
